    {
      "id": "44115624",
      "title": "Interacting With Host Elements From Inside Components",
      "lectureOrder": 115,
      "videoOrder": 109,
      "sourceHash": "37697fa929247a91f1720029150bcbd25d11d97f59e358d0df96a5faf63256ea",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.6,
          "end": 2.76,
          "en": "Of course we now have that duplication,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.76,
          "end": 6.81,
          "en": "we have to add that class whenever we use app-control,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.81,
          "end": 9.96,
          "en": "and that's something that's easy to forget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.96,
          "end": 12.9,
          "en": "It's also some unnecessary work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.9,
          "end": 15.6,
          "en": "That's why Angular gives you another way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.6,
          "end": 20.6,
          "en": "of adding attributes and properties to your host elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.33,
          "end": 24.34,
          "en": "We can remove that class here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.77,
          "end": 29.76,
          "en": "and then go to our ControlComponent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.76,
          "end": 31.98,
          "en": "And there we can add another setting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.98,
          "end": 36.48,
          "en": "to the Component Decorator, another configuration property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.48,
          "end": 39.093,
          "en": "and that's the host property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 39.93,
          "end": 44.52,
          "en": "Now, host wants an object as a value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 44.52,
          "end": 46.29,
          "en": "and that object then takes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 46.29,
          "end": 49.14,
          "en": "any key value pairs of your choice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 49.14,
          "end": 51.48,
          "en": "But what this object will do is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51.48,
          "end": 55.41,
          "en": "it will add the key value pairs you add here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.41,
          "end": 58.863,
          "en": "as properties on your host element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 60.06,
          "end": 62.67,
          "en": "So here I could add a key named class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.67,
          "end": 64.72,
          "en": "and set the value to control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 66.12,
          "end": 69.99,
          "en": "and that will add this class attribute, you could say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.99,
          "end": 74.913,
          "en": "this class property to app-control wherever it's being used.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 75.93,
          "end": 78.24,
          "en": "So I only need to define it once here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 78.24,
          "end": 81.33,
          "en": "but it will be added to all app-controls",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 81.33,
          "end": 83.10300000000001,
          "en": "anywhere in the application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 84.87,
          "end": 87.51,
          "en": "So if I save that and I reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 87.51,
          "end": 90.69,
          "en": "this still looks the way it did before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 90.69,
          "end": 94.68,
          "en": "but if I now inspect that, you see that on app-control,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 94.68,
          "end": 98.19,
          "en": "there is this class and that's now here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 98.19,
          "end": 101.25,
          "en": "because of this host property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 101.25,
          "end": 104.163,
          "en": "we added to this Component Decorator.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 105.36,
          "end": 107.67,
          "en": "And you can use this host property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 107.67,
          "end": 111.53999999999999,
          "en": "not just when encapsulation is set to none,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 111.53999999999999,
          "end": 113.75999999999999,
          "en": "instead, you can always add this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 113.75999999999999,
          "end": 117.03,
          "en": "if you have certain properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 117.03,
          "end": 120.45,
          "en": "that should be added to the host element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 120.45,
          "end": 124.053,
          "en": "and that can be another useful feature.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
